      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102090000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Hello, you've reached VeloFit. My name is Diana. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102098266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21127,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102103399999
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly help with that. Can I get your name and order number to pull up your account?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102105399999
    },
    {
      "text": "The name is Alex Chen, order number 774-B-91.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21127,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102111799999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Alex. I see your order for the Aero Road Helmet. Just to be sure I understand, what specifically is the issue with the helmet? Is it a technical fault or a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102114999999
    },
    {
      "text": "The color. I don't like it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21127,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102127066665
    },
    {
      "text": "I see. Sometimes the shades can look a bit different in person. Have you already used it?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102129066665
    },
    {
      "text": "No. The box unopened. It's just been sitting there.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21127,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102135199998
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, that's helpful. Let me just pull up our return policy for you. I see here that your helmet was delivered 21 days ago. You are well within our 90-day return window, so this is no problem at all.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102138799998
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. So you'll take it back?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21127,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102152266664
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, absolutely. I'm processing the return now and have just sent a prepaid shipping label to the email we have on file for you. Just print that out, attach it to the original packaging, and drop it off.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102154666664
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21127,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102168399997
    },
    {
      "text": "And Alex, I see you're one of our VIP members. We really appreciate your business. To thank you for your patience, and to help you find a helmet you'll love, I've added a $25 credit to your account for your next purchase. We want to make sure your safety gear is something you're happy with.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 401,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102169099997
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. I guess that's something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 21127,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1767102188699997
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. You'll see that credit applied automatically at your next checkout. Is there anything else I can assist with today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
